{"articleNo":"1530","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=1530&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"MOS 국제인증 자격시험 응시일정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.12.06","hit":"11259","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 22pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 170%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;HY헤드라인M&quot;\">MOS 국제인증 자격시험 응시일정 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 170%\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 8pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 81.1pt; TEXT-INDENT: -81.1pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 190%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">1. 목&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 적 : </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">우리학교 재학생들에게 MOS 국제인증 자격증 취득 기회를 제공함으로써</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 190%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 취업 역량을 강화하기 위함</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 시험장소 : 우리학교 공동실습관 315호</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 세부 응시일정 / 과목</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 120%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 120%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span>\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: medium none; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\